# SQL Server backend support (AAP-98732).
# Installed only by the py312-mssql tox environments and, eventually, by the
# shipped SQL Server container image on top of requirements.txt. Keeping the
# ODBC stack out of the base requirements avoids requiring unixODBC in every
# environment and keeps Python 3.11 installs installable.
mssql-django
aioodbc  # dispatcherd sql_server broker; use dispatcherd[sqlserver] once a release ships it
